---
/** What the reader is able to do after the chapter: a short list of skills, each starting with a verb. */
---

<section class="now-you-can my-12 rounded border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50/60 p-6">
  <div class="micro-label mb-3 text-stone-900">You can now</div>
  <div class="text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-700"><slot /></div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  .now-you-can ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .now-you-can li {
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    padding-left: 1.75rem;
  }
  .now-you-can li::before {
    content: '✓';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
